If you took your hands off the steering wheel of your life and allowed yourself to relax and be the passenger, what would happen? Or as Arjuna Ardagh puts it, what would your life be like if you set aside your need to control reality, and without judgmental beliefs embraced all that arose in any given moment? On Let Yourself Go, this visionary author and teacher invites you to discover what's really driving your life-an intricate system of unexamined points of view that upon conscious and compassionate investigation naturally release their hold. The result: the effortless joy, serenity, and insight of the awakened state. In the course of writing his breakthrough book The Translucent Revolution, Arjuna Ardagh surveyed some 13,000 people from all walks of life-including nearly 200 spiritual teachers-who shared the experience of radical realization that comes when we commit to a life unhindered by the delusions of the mind. These translucents, as he describes them, radiate the awareness of our divine nature through the various guises of our human nature. On Let Yourself Go, you join Arjuna Ardagh for a progressive series of exercises that leads you through the mental, physical, emotional, and energetic levels where our points of view manifest. With him, you will learn how to liberate even the most deeply held convictions that obscure your true identity."ø

